 r←Test_TableEdit_039(stopFlag batchFlag);n;i;⎕TRAP;fns
⍝ Exercise private function "ConvertDateBack"
⍝ Here it is save to assume that the right argument is always a valid IDF because the `Table` will ensure this.
 r←T._Inactive
 :Return

 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 fns←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.ExecPrivateFns

 →T.PassesIf 42367≡42367 fns'ConvertDateBack' '2015-12-30'                ⍝ IDN
 →T.PassesIf'2010-01-12'≡'2010-01-12'fns'ConvertDateBack' '2010-01-12'    ⍝ IDF
 →T.PassesIf 19881231=19881231 fns'ConvertDateBack' '1988-12-31'          ⍝ Integer
 →T.PassesIf 19881231=19881231.123413 fns'ConvertDateBack' '1988-12-31'   ⍝ Float
 →T.PassesIf 1011 1 3≡1011 1 3 fns'ConvertDateBack' '1011-01-03'          ⍝ Timestamp

 r←T._OK
